<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Capital One upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Capital One upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it upgraded Capital One Financial Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- said has confidence Capital One will meet earnings expectations of $2.31 a share in 1996 and $2.75 a share in 1997.</p>
<p>-- set a six-month price target of $42 a share.</p>
<p>-- Capital One gained 3-3/4 to 37-1/4 in late morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
